{"id":"formularios-atributos-avanzados-y-controles-de-envio","title":"Formularios - Atributos avanzados y controles de envío","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":1,"words":102,"backlinks":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><ul>\n<li><strong><code>readonly</code> vs <code>disabled</code></strong>: Ambos atributos impiden que el usuario edite un campo de entrada, pero tienen un comportamiento crucialmente diferente en el envío de datos:<ul>\n<li><code>readonly</code>: El campo se puede enfocar, copiar y <strong>sí se envía</strong> con el formulario.</li>\n<li><code>disabled</code>: El campo se desactiva por completo, visualmente se apaga, no se enfoca y <strong>no se envía</strong> con el formulario.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Atributos <code>form*</code></strong>: Permiten a los botones de envío (<code>type=&quot;submit&quot;</code>) sobrescribir la configuración del formulario padre (como la URL de destino o validaciones), permitiendo múltiples acciones desde un mismo formulario.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- readonly vs disabled --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;curso&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Curso seleccionado (Editable y se envía):<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;curso&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;curso&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HTML y CSS Avanzado&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">readonly</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;codigo&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Código de descuento (Desactivado y NO se envía):<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;descuento&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;codigo&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;PROMO2026&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">disabled</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Botones con atributos form* que sobrescriben el formulario --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">action</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/guardar&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;post&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;formularioRegistro&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombre&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Nombre:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombre&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombre&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Envío por defecto a /guardar --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;submit&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Guardar<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  \n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Envía a /previsualizar abriendo en pestaña nueva --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;submit&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">formaction</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/previsualizar&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">formtarget</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;_blank&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    Previsualizar\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  \n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Envía saltándose la validación obligatoria required --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;submit&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">formnovalidate</span>&gt;</span>\n    Guardar borrador\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>"}